Option: Using VS Code Instead (No SDK Needed)

If you just want an AI assistant to help write, explain, or debug code inside your editor, you do not need the SDK.

Install the Extension. Open Visual Studio Code, go to the Extensions view (Ctrl+Shift+X), and install Gemini Code Assist.

Sign In. Log in with your Google account directly inside VS Code to start using inline completions and AI chat without managing packages or API keys.
